{"id":"n62423-1-8","stage":4,"title":"상심 · 伤心","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n62423-1-8-1","ko":"이번 시험에는 꼭 붙을 줄 알았는데.","zh":"我本来以为这次考试我一定能通过的。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이번","meaning":"这次，这回","explanation":"이번：这次，这回。","readings":[{"term":"이번","audio":"/audio/da78d4146f0588e8450a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29737","senseId":"1","lemma":"이번","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이번","audio":"/audio/da78d4146f0588e8450a.mp3"}},{"text":"시험에는","meaning":"考试","explanation":"시험：考试；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"시험","audio":"/audio/ff65dc582ce71198934b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20233","senseId":"1","lemma":"시험","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"시험에는","audio":"/audio/7efcb7273e59358a173c.mp3"}},{"text":"꼭","meaning":"一定，必定","explanation":"꼭：一定，必定。","readings":[{"term":"꼭","audio":"/audio/712da780b7ecf8b736b3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"48064","senseId":"1","lemma":"꼭","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"꼭","audio":"/audio/712da780b7ecf8b736b3.mp3"}},{"text":"붙을","meaning":"考上，通过","explanation":"붙다：考上，通过；을：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"붙다","audio":"/audio/25c69080a9810c70a4d0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74181","senseId":"2","lemma":"붙다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"붙을","audio":"/audio/84716751f6c3489b3d28.mp3"}},{"text":"줄","meaning":"表示某个方法或实际内容等。","explanation":"줄：表示某个方法或实际内容等。","readings":[{"term":"줄","audio":"/audio/4e04e3938cc9c67ed71b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91870","senseId":"1","lemma":"줄","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"줄","audio":"/audio/4e04e3938cc9c67ed71b.mp3"}},{"text":"알았는데.","meaning":"以为","explanation":"알다：以为；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；는데：在句末提出背景、感想或含蓄的对照，留有后续语意；非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"알다","audio":"/audio/4646a3463436c8a43feb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89445","senseId":"12","lemma":"알다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"알았는데","audio":"/audio/11427db942888828998d.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"da78d4146f0588e8","term":"이번","zh":"这次，这回","audio":"/audio/da78d4146f0588e8450a.mp3","entryId":"29737","definition":"马上到来的顺序；或指刚过去的顺序。","pronunciation":["이번"]},{"id":"ff65dc582ce71198","term":"시험","zh":"考试","audio":"/audio/ff65dc582ce71198934b.mp3","entryId":"20233","definition":"按照问题、提问、实际行动等一定程序考核考生的知识或能力的事宜。","pronunciation":["시험"]},{"id":"712da780b7ecf8b7","term":"꼭","zh":"一定，必定","audio":"/audio/712da780b7ecf8b736b3.mp3","entryId":"48064","definition":"无论有什么事情也务必。","pronunciation":["꼭"]},{"id":"25c69080a9810c70","term":"붙다","zh":"考上，通过","audio":"/audio/25c69080a9810c70a4d0.mp3","entryId":"74181","definition":"考试等合格。","pronunciation":["붇따"]},{"id":"4e04e3938cc9c67e","term":"줄","zh":"表示某个方法或实际内容等。","audio":"/audio/4e04e3938cc9c67ed71b.mp3","entryId":"91870","definition":"表示某个方法或实际内容等。","pronunciation":["줄"]},{"id":"4646a3463436c8a4","term":"알다","zh":"以为","audio":"/audio/4646a3463436c8a43feb.mp3","entryId":"89445","definition":"对于某个事实，认为或觉得如此。","pronunciation":["알ː다"]}],"audio":"/audio/37f4da1fb10379d78413.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n62423-1-8-2","ko":"너무 상심 말고 기운을 좀 차리도록 해.","zh":"别太难过，振作起来吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"너무","meaning":"太","explanation":"너무：太。","readings":[{"term":"너무","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28183","senseId":"1","lemma":"너무","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"너무","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3"}},{"text":"상심","meaning":"伤心","explanation":"상심：伤心。","readings":[{"term":"상심","audio":"/audio/c0965aab7eef4c86b529.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62423","senseId":"1","lemma":"상심","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"상심","audio":"/audio/c0965aab7eef4c86b529.mp3"}},{"text":"말고","meaning":"不做","explanation":"말다：不做；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","r