。","pronunciation":["말ː다"]},{"id":"f4dbd5949553c626","term":"기운","zh":"气息，氛围","audio":"/audio/f4dbd5949553c62639c7.mp3","entryId":"38086","definition":"肉眼看不到、但能感受到的力量或气氛。","pronunciation":["기운"]},{"id":"70ae9bc35b2d378b","term":"좀","zh":"一下","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3","entryId":"75798","definition":"主要用于委婉请求或征得同意。","pronunciation":["좀"]},{"id":"967898219777e9f4","term":"차리다","zh":"振作，抖擞","audio":"/audio/967898219777e9f4fca1.mp3","entryId":"71366","definition":"重新打起精神或提起劲头等。","pronunciation":["차리다"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"表示使做前面的行动或使成为前面所指的状态。","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"62888","definition":"表示使做前面的行动或使成为前面所指的状态。","pronunciation":["하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/c56dfe624d300638278b.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.129,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=62423","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":149,"sequenceScore":2.9557,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["我本来以为这次考试我一定能通过的。","别太难过，振作起来吧。","这个句子应该填入什么形式的谓语？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["我本来以为这次考试我一定能通过的。","别太难过，振作起来吧。","这个句子应该填入什么形式的谓语？"],"answer":1}]}
